  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 76 ÷ 4 + 108 × 3 – 5 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after '+' and '-' are interchanged and '×' and '÷' are interchanged:\n\n76 ÷ 4 + 108 × 3 – 5 = ? ⇒ 76 × 4 - 108 ÷ 3 + 5 = ?\n\n⇒ 76 × 4 - __**108 **____**÷**____** 3**__ + 5 = ?\n\n⇒ __**76 ×**____** 4**__ - 36 + 5 = ?\n\n⇒ __**304**____** + 5**__ - 36 = ?\n\n⇒ __309____** - 36**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **273**** = ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
